- core/stats/regression_checks.py: influence_measures (leverage,
  standardized, prediction and deletion residuals, Cook D, modified Cook
  C), regression_diagnostics (per-observation table, thresholds 2p/N,
  |r(i)| > 2, C > 2√((N − p)/N), refit without influential points, plot
  data incl. half-Normal) and regression_cross_validation (split, leave-1-out
  with PRESS, k-fold; PB, MAD, MSEP, RMSE and percentages).
- Optional transforms of y and x (log10(conc + 1) as in Example 13.1).
- Tests against Table 13.2 and Examples 13.2A–C; measures checked
  against statsmodels and by refitting without each observation.
- Catalog, i18n, bridge (XY kind, scatter, residual plots, histogram), messages.

